chunks.text:
[Intro]
{a cold sub-bass drone, a single detuned chime ringing in the dark}
{a reversed riser that slams into a massive deep brass blast on the last beat}

[Nights]
{relentless dark horror pulse: distorted 808 sub bass, pounding toms, trap hi-hats in half-time}
{a sour, detuned casino-chime melody on top, like a slot machine bell played wrong, a dissonant string ostinato}
{the tension rises non-stop and hits harder every 8 bars, peaking in the last three seconds}

[Reveal]
{one second of dead silence, then a colossal horror explosion}
{huge deep brass blasts, a wordless dark choir, distorted drums, screeching strings, maximum terror}
{a first massive hit at 6 seconds, a brutal hit at 12.6 seconds, then a ringing aftermath}
